+(deftest similar-by-meaning-ranks-the-public-functions-agents-call
+  ;; Measured 2026-10-18: over every function, private helpers outranked the verbs (my.program/search-match over
+  ;; my.program/search); over the public ones, 9 of 15 intent queries named their function first.
